## Deliverables (agent workdir root)
- **13 csv** (`admissions/cohort/demographics/diagnoses/procedures/medications/labs`, `icu/{icustays,chartevents,inputevents,outputevents}`, `multimodal/ecg_{manifest,measurements}`) — built from the **validation raw**
- **`submission.json`** — `schema_version=1`, `result_root="."`, `replay.argv` = `["python3","scripts/replay.py","--raw_root","{raw_root}","--output_dir","{output_dir}", …]`
- **`train_analysis.json`** — per-file raw source / key / time anchor / filters / transformations + **15 error patterns, each with train evidence** + the train self-check
- **`scripts/`** — `icu5000_pipeline.py` (pipeline), `replay.py` (entry point), `selfcheck.py`, `make_train_analysis.py`, `make_submission.py` + all diff/analysis scripts

## Rules derived from train raw ↔ train reference
| id | error | repair |
|---|---|---|
| E1 | itemid alias `992{2\|3}XXXX` | `"2"+alias[3]+alias[-4:]` (99220045→220045, 99230085→230085) |
| E2 | stay_id with spurious leading digit | strip it (key repair **before** de-dup) |
| E3 | label-leakage rows `valuenum='(insert)'` | drop — found exactly **2881** train / **1062** validation rows, matching the documented counts |
| E4/E5 | valuenum ×100 / sentinel / text-row garbage | trust the numeric `value` text; descriptive rows → empty |
| E6 | icustay outtime reversed | `outtime = intime + los` |
| E7 | chartevents charttime pushed past ICU discharge | session charttime (subject/stay/storetime/caregiver), else `floor(storetime,'h')` |
| E8 | outputevents epoch charttime | `floor(storetime,'h')` (198/445 exact) |
| E9/E10 | inputevents amount/endtime, hadm_id mismatch | amount=originalamount→totalamount→rate×duration×unit-factor; hadm from icustays |
| E11/E12/E13 | `ALIAS_` icd codes, patients gender/age, flipped `hospital_expire_flag` | strip prefix, sex from note header, flag recomputed from `deathtime` |
| E14/E15 | injected duplicates, native MIMIC out-of-range/sentinel values | de-dup **after** key/value repair; native → patient/item median (in-range pool, ≥20 % deviation) |

**Cohort** = ICU stays with a hospital admission *and* ICU input events → reproduces the train gold exactly (7 rows, same subjects).

